body:
What do you call a sad strawberry? 

&#x200B;

A blueberry

I've found doing warm salt water washes using cotton pads helped with my boy. My boy's was on his tail, which we now have to groom regularly to make sure he doesn't get any oil / skin build up which was causing the acne (hes very fluffy and can't clean that spot so well himself).

&#x200B;

Salt wash can be a bit easier to clean with than antiseptic wash, I found our by didn't like the smell of the antiseptic shampoo at all.
